        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 6:10AM EDT until September 26 at 11:00PM EDT by NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northwest winds 15 to 20 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and
choppy waters.

* WHERE...Albemarle Sound and Alligator River.

* WHEN...Until 11 PM EDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Moderate winds will continue to impact
the inland rivers and sounds as a Nor'easter moves slowly
north off the Mid-Atlantic Coast.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
